<title>UK: Guinness sets 125 mln Swiss franc bond.</title>
<headline>Guinness sets 125 mln Swiss franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credit Suisse.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GUINNESS PLC</p>
<p> AMT    125 MLN SFR   COUPON     3.00	MATURITY    26.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.85    PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA-/AA3   DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
